{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 05 · Dashboard Export\n",
    "## Building the Interactive Risk Intelligence Dashboard\n",
    "\n",
    "### Prerequisites\n",
    "Run notebooks 01, 02, 03, and 04 first. The following must be in memory or on disk:\n",
    "- `df` — merged DataFrame (from notebook 01)\n",
    "- `G` — NetworkX graph (from notebook 01)\n",
    "- `full_features.csv` — produced by notebook 02\n",
    "- `unknown_node_predictions.csv` — produced by notebook 03\n",
    "- `ts_stats` — time step statistics DataFrame (from notebook 04)\n",
    "- `all_ts`, `conf_counts`, `pred_counts` — timeline data (from notebook 04)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### What this notebook does\n",
    "Builds a fully self-contained interactive HTML dashboard that opens in any browser\n",
    "with no running Python server required. The dashboard includes:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Component | Description |\n",
    "|-----------|-------------|\n",
    "| **Model gauges** | AUC, Recall, F1, Average Precision displayed as visual gauges |\n",
    "| **Network graph** | 500 highest-risk nodes, coloured by class, top-10 highlighted in gold |\n",
    "| **Node detail panel** | Click any node to see its full risk profile |\n",
    "| **Ranking table** | Top-20 nodes by GNN risk score |\n",
    "| **Timeline chart** | Confirmed + GNN-predicted illicit by time step |\n",
    "| **Burst detection chart** | Illicit rate with statistical anomaly flagging |\n",
    "| **Class filter** | Filters all components simultaneously |\n",
    "| **Footer** | Project attribution — Opeyemi Mercy Lawan |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Output\n",
    "- `risk_dashboard.html` — self-contained HTML dashboard"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Install plotly for interactive visualisations\n",
    "import subprocess, sys\n",
    "subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, '-m', 'pip', 'install', 'plotly', '-q'])\n",
    "\n",
    "import plotly\n",
    "import plotly.graph_objects as go\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import networkx as nx\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'✅ Plotly ready — version: {plotly.__version__}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Load all required data files\n",
    "full_df    = pd.read_csv('full_features.csv')\n",
    "unknown_df = pd.read_csv('unknown_node_predictions.csv')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Full features  : {full_df.shape}')\n",
    "print(f'Unknown preds  : {unknown_df.shape}')\n",
    "print('✅ Data loaded')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Helper function — converts hex colour to rgba for Plotly table compatibility\n",
    "# Plotly tables do NOT support 8-digit hex (#RRGGBBAA) — must use rgba()\n",
    "def hex_to_rgba(hex_color, alpha=0.2):\n",
    "    h = hex_color.lstrip('#')\n",
    "    r, g, b = int(h[0:2],16), int(h[2:4],16), int(h[4:6],16)\n",
    "    return f'rgba({r},{g},{b},{alpha})'\n",
    "\n",
    "CLASS_COL = {'Illicit':'#FF4444', 'Licit':'#00C9A7', 'Unknown':'#AAAAAA'}\n",
    "print('✅ Helper functions ready')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 1 — Prepare Risk Scores and Network Graph Sample"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Build composite risk scores using GNN probabilities\n",
    "# Then sample top 500 nodes for the network graph visualisation\n",
    "print('Preparing network graph data...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Attach GNN probabilities to full node list\n",
    "# probs variable comes from notebook 03 — GNN illicit probability for every node\n",
    "all_risk = full_df[['txId', 'time_step', 'class', 'class_label']].copy()\n",
    "all_risk['illicit_prob'] = probs  # from notebook 03\n",
    "all_risk['risk_score']   = all_risk['illicit_prob']\n",
    "all_risk = all_risk.sort_values('risk_score', ascending=False).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "all_risk['rank'] = all_risk.index + 1\n",
    "\n",
    "top10_ids = set(all_risk.head(10)['txId'])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Sample for visualisation — keep top 50 risk nodes + random sample of rest\n",
    "MAX_NODES   = 500\n",
    "sample_pool = all_risk.iloc[50:]['txId'].tolist()\n",
    "sampled_ids = list(all_risk.head(50)['txId']) + list(\n",
    "    np.random.default_rng(42).choice(\n",
    "        sample_pool, size=min(MAX_NODES-50, len(sample_pool)), replace=False\n",
    "    )\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "sub = G.subgraph(sampled_ids).copy()\n",
    "pos = nx.spring_layout(sub, seed=42, k=0.6)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Subgraph nodes : {sub.number_of_nodes():,}')\n",
    "print(f'Subgraph edges : {sub.number_of_edges():,}')\n",
    "print('✅ Network graph data ready')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 2 — Build All Plotly Figures"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Build the interactive network graph — nodes coloured by class, top-10 in gold\n",
    "print('Building network graph...')\n",
    "\n",
    "ex, ey = [], []\n",
    "for u, v in sub.edges():\n",
    "    if u in pos and v in pos:\n",
    "        ex += [pos[u][0], pos[v][0], None]\n",
    "        ey += [pos[u][1], pos[v][1], None]\n",
    "\n",
    "edge_trace = go.Scatter(\n",
    "    x=ex, y=ey, mode='lines',\n",
    "    line=dict(width=0.4, color='#333344'),\n",
    "    hoverinfo='none', showlegend=False\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "sub_risk   = all_risk[all_risk['txId'].isin(sub.nodes())].set_index('txId')\n",
    "node_traces = []\n",
    "for cls_label, colour in CLASS_COL.items():\n",
    "    sub_cls = sub_risk[sub_risk['class_label'] == cls_label]\n",
    "    if sub_cls.empty: continue\n",
    "    valid = [n for n in sub_cls.index if n in pos]\n",
    "    if not valid: continue\n",
    "    node_traces.append(go.Scatter(\n",
    "        x=[pos[n][0] for n in valid],\n",
    "        y=[pos[n][1] for n in valid],\n",
    "        mode='markers',\n",
    "        marker=dict(\n",
    "            size=[16 if n in top10_ids else 7 for n in valid],\n",
    "            color=colour,\n",
    "            line=dict(\n",
    "                width=[3 if n in top10_ids else 0 for n in valid],\n",
    "                color='#FFD700'\n",
    "            )\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "        text=[\n",
    "            f'txId: {n}<br>Class: {cls_label}<br>'\n",
    "            f'Risk: {sub_cls.loc[n,\"risk_score\"]:.4f}<br>'\n",
    "            f'Rank: {int(sub_cls.loc[n,\"rank\"])}<br>'\n",
    "            f'Time Step: {int(sub_cls.loc[n,\"time_step\"])}'\n",
    "            for n in valid\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        hoverinfo='text',\n",
    "        name=cls_label,\n",
    "        customdata=[\n",
    "            [n, cls_label,\n",
    "             round(float(sub_cls.loc[n,'risk_score']),4),\n",
    "             int(sub_cls.loc[n,'rank']),\n",
    "             int(sub_cls.loc[n,'time_step'])]\n",
    "            for n in valid\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    ))\n",
    "\n",
    "fig_network = go.Figure(data=[edge_trace] + node_traces)\n",
    "fig_network.update_layout(\n",
    "    paper_bgcolor='#0D0D1A', plot_bgcolor='#0D0D1A',\n",
    "    font=dict(color='white'), showlegend=True,\n",
    "    legend=dict(bgcolor='#1A1A2E', bordercolor='#333'),\n",
    "    xaxis=dict(showgrid=False, zeroline=False, showticklabels=False),\n",
    "    yaxis=dict(showgrid=False, zeroline=False, showticklabels=False),\n",
    "    margin=dict(l=10,r=10,t=10,b=10), height=520\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('✅ Network graph built')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Build ranking table — top 20 nodes by GNN risk score\n",
    "top20 = all_risk.head(20)[['rank','txId','class_label','risk_score','time_step']].copy()\n",
    "top20['risk_score'] = top20['risk_score'].round(4)\n",
    "fill_colours = [[hex_to_rgba(CLASS_COL.get(c,'#AAAAAA')) for c in top20['class_label']]]\n",
    "\n",
    "table_trace = go.Table(\n",
    "    header=dict(\n",
    "        values=['<b>#</b>','<b>txId</b>','<b>Class</b>',\n",
    "                '<b>Risk Score</b>','<b>Time Step</b>'],\n",
    "        fill_color='#1A1A2E', font=dict(color='white', size=12),\n",
    "        align='center', height=32\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "    cells=dict(\n",
    "        values=[\n",
    "            top20['rank'].tolist(), top20['txId'].tolist(),\n",
    "            top20['class_label'].tolist(), top20['risk_score'].tolist(),\n",
    "            top20['time_step'].tolist(),\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        fill_color=fill_colours * 5,\n",
    "        font=dict(color='white', size=11),\n",
    "        align=['center','left','center','center','center'],\n",
    "        height=28\n",
    "    )\n",
    ")\n",
    "fig_table = go.Figure(data=[table_trace])\n",
    "fig_table.update_layout(\n",
    "    paper_bgcolor='#0D0D1A', font=dict(color='white'),\n",
    "    margin=dict(l=0,r=0,t=10,b=0), height=630\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('✅ Ranking table built')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Build combined timeline — confirmed + GNN-predicted illicit by time step\n",
    "confirmed_ts = full_df[full_df['class']==1].groupby('time_step').size()\n",
    "predicted_ts = unknown_df[unknown_df['predicted_label']=='Illicit'].groupby('time_step').size()\n",
    "all_ts       = sorted(set(confirmed_ts.index) | set(predicted_ts.index))\n",
    "conf_counts  = [confirmed_ts.get(t,0) for t in all_ts]\n",
    "pred_counts  = [predicted_ts.get(t,0) for t in all_ts]\n",
    "\n",
    "fig_time = go.Figure(data=[\n",
    "    go.Bar(x=all_ts, y=conf_counts, name='Confirmed Illicit',\n",
    "           marker_color='#FF4444', opacity=0.9),\n",
    "    go.Bar(x=all_ts, y=pred_counts, name='GNN-Predicted Illicit',\n",
    "           marker_color='#FF9900', opacity=0.7)\n",
    "])\n",
    "fig_time.update_layout(\n",
    "    barmode='stack', paper_bgcolor='#0D0D1A', plot_bgcolor='#0D0D1A',\n",
    "    font=dict(color='white'),\n",
    "    xaxis=dict(title='Time Step', gridcolor='#222233', color='white'),\n",
    "    yaxis=dict(title='Node Count', gridcolor='#222233', color='white'),\n",
    "    legend=dict(bgcolor='#1A1A2E'),\n",
    "    margin=dict(l=40,r=20,t=20,b=40), height=340\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('✅ Timeline chart built')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Build burst detection chart — illicit rate with z-score anomaly flagging\n",
    "# ts_stats comes from notebook 04\n",
    "burst_colours = ['#FF4444' if b else '#4A90D9' for b in ts_stats['is_burst']]\n",
    "\n",
    "fig_burst = go.Figure(data=[go.Bar(\n",
    "    x=ts_stats['time_step'], y=ts_stats['illicit_rate'],\n",
    "    marker_color=burst_colours, opacity=0.85, name='Illicit Rate',\n",
    "    hovertemplate='Time Step: %{x}<br>Illicit Rate: %{y:.3f}<extra></extra>'\n",
    ")])\n",
    "fig_burst.add_hline(\n",
    "    y=float(ts_stats['illicit_rate'].mean()),\n",
    "    line_color='#FFD700', line_dash='dash', line_width=1.5,\n",
    "    annotation_text=f\"Mean: {ts_stats['illicit_rate'].mean():.3f}\",\n",
    "    annotation_font_color='#FFD700'\n",
    ")\n",
    "fig_burst.add_hline(\n",
    "    y=float(ts_stats['illicit_rate'].mean() + 1.5*ts_stats['illicit_rate'].std()),\n",
    "    line_color='#FF4444', line_dash='dot', line_width=1,\n",
    "    annotation_text='Burst threshold (1.5σ)',\n",
    "    annotation_font_color='#FF4444'\n",
    ")\n",
    "fig_burst.update_layout(\n",
    "    paper_bgcolor='#0D0D1A', plot_bgcolor='#0D0D1A',\n",
    "    font=dict(color='white'),\n",
    "    xaxis=dict(title='Time Step', gridcolor='#222233', color='white'),\n",
    "    yaxis=dict(title='Illicit Rate', gridcolor='#222233', color='white'),\n",
    "    margin=dict(l=40,r=20,t=20,b=40), height=340, showlegend=False\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('✅ Burst detection chart built')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Build model performance gauges — AUC, Recall, F1, Average Precision\n",
    "fig_gauges = go.Figure()\n",
    "metrics = [\n",
    "    ('AUC-ROC',  0.957,  '#00C9A7'),\n",
    "    ('Recall',   0.910,  '#FF4444'),\n",
    "    ('F1 Score', 0.4241, '#4A90D9'),\n",
    "    ('Avg Prec', 0.8380, '#FFD700'),\n",
    "]\n",
    "for i, (name, val, colour) in enumerate(metrics):\n",
    "    fig_gauges.add_trace(go.Indicator(\n",
    "        mode='gauge+number',\n",
    "        value=val,\n",
    "        title=dict(text=name, font=dict(color='white', size=13)),\n",
    "        number=dict(font=dict(color=colour, size=22)),\n",
    "        gauge=dict(\n",
    "            axis=dict(range=[0,1], tickcolor='white',\n",
    "                      tickfont=dict(color='white', size=9)),\n",
    "            bar=dict(color=colour),\n",
    "            bgcolor='#1A1A2E', bordercolor='#333',\n",
    "            steps=[dict(range=[0,1], color='#0D0D1A')],\n",
    "            threshold=dict(line=dict(color='white', width=2),\n",
    "                           thickness=0.75, value=val)\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "        domain=dict(x=[i*0.25, (i+1)*0.25], y=[0,1])\n",
    "    ))\n",
    "fig_gauges.update_layout(\n",
    "    paper_bgcolor='#0D0D1A', font=dict(color='white'),\n",
    "    margin=dict(l=20,r=20,t=40,b=20), height=220\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('✅ Model performance gauges built')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 3 — Serialise All Figures to JSON"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Serialise all figures and data to JSON strings for embedding in HTML\n",
    "net_json_str    = fig_network.to_json()\n",
    "table_json_str  = fig_table.to_json()\n",
    "time_json_str   = fig_time.to_json()\n",
    "burst_json_str  = fig_burst.to_json()\n",
    "gauges_json_str = fig_gauges.to_json()\n",
    "\n",
    "all_nodes_json_str = all_risk[['txId','class_label','risk_score',\n",
    "                                'time_step','rank']].to_json(orient='records')\n",
    "\n",
    "class_opts_html = ''.join(\n",
    "    f'<option value=\"{o}\">{o}</option>'\n",
    "    for o in ['All'] + sorted(all_risk['class_label'].unique().tolist())\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "total_edges_val       = G.number_of_edges()\n",
    "confirmed_illicit_val = int((full_df['class']==1).sum())\n",
    "gnn_predicted_val     = int((unknown_df['predicted_label']=='Illicit').sum())\n",
    "burst_steps_str_val   = str(ts_stats[ts_stats['is_burst']]['time_step'].tolist())\n",
    "\n",
    "print('✅ All figures serialised')\n",
    "print(f'  Confirmed illicit : {confirmed_illicit_val:,}')\n",
    "print(f'  GNN predicted     : {gnn_predicted_val:,}')\n",
    "print(f'  Burst steps       : {burst_steps_str_val}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 4 — Build HTML Head and Styles"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# HTML head — title, Plotly CDN, Google Fonts, and all CSS styles\n",
    "html_head = \"\"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\n",
    "<html lang=\"en\">\n",
    "<head>\n",
    "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"/>\n",
    "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"/>\n",
    "<title>Bitcoin Network Risk Dashboard — Opeyemi Mercy Lawan</title>\n",
    "<script src=\"https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.30.0.min.js\"></script>\n",
    "<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&family=Exo+2:wght@300;600;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n",
    "<style>\n",
    "  :root{--bg:#090912;--panel:#11111e;--border:#1e1e35;--accent:#00e5ff;\n",
    "        --red:#ff4444;--green:#00c9a7;--grey:#888;--gold:#ffd700;\n",
    "        --font-mono:\"Share Tech Mono\",monospace;--font-body:\"Exo 2\",sans-serif;}\n",
    "  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\n",
    "  body{background:var(--bg);color:#e8e8f0;font-family:var(--font-body);min-height:100vh}\n",
    "  header{padding:18px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n",
    "         border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);\n",
    "         background:linear-gradient(90deg,#090912 60%,#0d0d2a)}\n",
    "  header h1{font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;\n",
    "            color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase}\n",
    "  header span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--grey)}\n",
    "  .stats{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n",
    "  .stat{flex:1;padding:14px 20px;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid var(--border)}\n",
    "  .stat:last-child{border-right:none}\n",
    "  .stat-val{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-family:var(--font-mono)}\n",
    "  .stat-lbl{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--grey);text-transform:uppercase;\n",
    "            letter-spacing:.07em;margin-top:3px}\n",
    "  .filter-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 32px;\n",
    "              background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n",
    "  .filter-bar label{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--grey);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}\n",
    "  .filter-bar select{background:#1a1a2e;color:#e8e8f0;border:1px solid var(--border);\n",
    "                     padding:6px 14px;border-radius:4px;font-family:var(--font-mono);\n",
    "                     font-size:.82rem;cursor:pointer;outline:none}\n",
    "  .filter-bar select:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}\n",
    "  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;padding:20px 28px}\n",
    "  .panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}\n",
    "  .panel-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 16px;\n",
    "                border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.78rem;\n",
    "                text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;\n",
    "                color:var(--accent);font-family:var(--font-mono)}\n",
    "  .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--accent)}\n",
    "  .full-row{grid-column:1/-1}\n",
    "  .legend{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-left:auto}\n",
    "  .pill{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:.72rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--grey)}\n",
    "  .pill-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%}\n",
    "  .detail-box{background:#0d0d1a;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:8px;\n",
    "              padding:16px 20px;margin:0 28px;font-family:var(--font-mono);\n",
    "              font-size:.82rem;display:none;}\n",
    "  .detail-box.visible{display:block}\n",
    "  .detail-box h3{color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:10px;font-size:.9rem}\n",
    "  .detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:12px}\n",
    "  .detail-item .d-lbl{color:var(--grey);font-size:.7rem;margin-bottom:3px}\n",
    "  .detail-item .d-val{color:#e8e8f0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700}\n",
    "  footer{margin:28px 28px 0 28px;padding:24px 32px;border:1px solid var(--border);\n",
    "         border-radius:8px;background:var(--panel);display:flex;align-items:center;\n",
    "         justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;}\n",
    "  .footer-left h2{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);\n",
    "                  letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}\n",
    "  .footer-left p{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--grey);margin-top:4px;font-family:var(--font-mono)}\n",
    "  .footer-right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px}\n",
    "  .footer-tag{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--grey)}\n",
    "  .footer-tag span{color:var(--accent)}\n",
    "  .footer-divider{width:100%;height:1px;\n",
    "                  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--accent),transparent);\n",
    "                  margin-bottom:4px}\n",
    "  .footer-bottom{width:100%;text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);\n",
    "                 font-size:.68rem;color:#444;margin-top:8px}\n",
    "  ::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px;height:5px}\n",
    "  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:var(--bg)}\n",
    "  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border);border-radius:3px}\n",
    "</style>\n",
    "</head>\"\"\"\n",
    "print('✅ HTML head ready')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 5 — Build HTML Body"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# HTML body — all dashboard panels and layout\n",
    "html_body = f\"\"\"\n",
    "<body>\n",
    "<header>\n",
    "  <h1>&#x2B21; Bitcoin Network &middot; Risk Intelligence Dashboard</h1>\n",
    "  <span id=\"nodecount\">203,769 nodes &middot; {total_edges_val:,} edges</span>\n",
    "</header>\n",
    "<div class=\"stats\">\n",
    "  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-val\">203,769</div><div class=\"stat-lbl\">Total Nodes</div></div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-val\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">{confirmed_illicit_val:,}</div><div class=\"stat-lbl\">Confirmed Illicit</div></div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-val\" style=\"color:#FF9900\">{gnn_predicted_val:,}</div><div class=\"stat-lbl\">GNN Predicted Illicit</div></div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-val\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">42,019</div><div class=\"stat-lbl\">Confirmed Licit</div></div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-val\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">{total_edges_val:,}</div><div class=\"stat-lbl\">Total Edges</div></div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"stat-val\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">1,971%</div><div class=\"stat-lbl\">Detection Increase</div></div>\n",
    "</div>\n",
    "<div class=\"filter-bar\">\n",
    "  <label>Filter by Class</label>\n",
    "  <select id=\"classFilter\" onchange=\"applyFilter()\">{class_opts_html}</select>\n",
    "  <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--grey)\" id=\"filter-info\"></span>\n",
    "</div>\n",
    "<div class=\"grid\">\n",
    "  <div class=\"panel full-row\">\n",
    "    <div class=\"panel-header\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>GraphSAGE Model Performance &mdash; Trained on Steps 1&ndash;34 &middot; Tested on 35&ndash;49</div>\n",
    "    <div id=\"gaugeChart\" style=\"width:100%;height:220px\"></div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"panel full-row\">\n",
    "    <div class=\"panel-header\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Interactive Network Graph &mdash; Top 500 Nodes by Risk Score\n",
    "      <div class=\"legend\">\n",
    "        <span class=\"pill\"><span class=\"pill-dot\" style=\"background:#ff4444\"></span>Illicit</span>\n",
    "        <span class=\"pill\"><span class=\"pill-dot\" style=\"background:#00c9a7\"></span>Licit</span>\n",
    "        <span class=\"pill\"><span class=\"pill-dot\" style=\"background:#aaa\"></span>Unknown</span>\n",
    "        <span class=\"pill\"><span class=\"pill-dot\" style=\"background:#ffd700;box-shadow:0 0 6px #ffd700\"></span>Top-10</span>\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "    <div id=\"networkGraph\" style=\"width:100%;height:530px\"></div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"detail-box full-row\" id=\"nodeDetail\">\n",
    "    <h3>&#x2B21; Node Detail &mdash; Click any node on the graph to inspect it</h3>\n",
    "    <div class=\"detail-grid\">\n",
    "      <div class=\"detail-item\"><div class=\"d-lbl\">Transaction ID</div><div class=\"d-val\" id=\"d-txid\">&ndash;</div></div>\n",
    "      <div class=\"detail-item\"><div class=\"d-lbl\">Class</div><div class=\"d-val\" id=\"d-class\">&ndash;</div></div>\n",
    "      <div class=\"detail-item\"><div class=\"d-lbl\">Risk Score</div><div class=\"d-val\" id=\"d-risk\">&ndash;</div></div>\n",
    "      <div class=\"detail-item\"><div class=\"d-lbl\">Global Rank</div><div class=\"d-val\" id=\"d-rank\">&ndash;</div></div>\n",
    "      <div class=\"detail-item\"><div class=\"d-lbl\">Time Step</div><div class=\"d-val\" id=\"d-ts\">&ndash;</div></div>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"panel\">\n",
    "    <div class=\"panel-header\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Top-20 Nodes by GNN Risk Score</div>\n",
    "    <div id=\"rankTable\" style=\"width:100%;height:630px\"></div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"panel\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n",
    "    <div class=\"panel-header\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Confirmed + GNN-Predicted Illicit by Time Step</div>\n",
    "    <div id=\"timeChart\" style=\"width:100%;flex:1;min-height:300px\"></div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"panel full-row\">\n",
    "    <div class=\"panel-header\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Temporal Burst Detection &mdash; Red Bars = Statistically Anomalous (z &gt; 1.5&sigma;)\n",
    "      &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#FF4444;font-size:.72rem\">Burst steps: {burst_steps_str_val}</span>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "    <div id=\"burstChart\" style=\"width:100%;height:340px\"></div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "</div>\n",
    "<footer>\n",
    "  <div class=\"footer-left\">\n",
    "    <h2>Opeyemi Mercy Lawan</h2>\n",
    "    <p>Bitcoin Transaction Network &middot; Fraud Detection Research &middot; 2025</p>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"footer-right\">\n",
    "    <div class=\"footer-tag\">Model &nbsp;<span>GraphSAGE</span></div>\n",
    "    <div class=\"footer-tag\">Dataset &nbsp;<span>Elliptic Bitcoin Dataset</span></div>\n",
    "    <div class=\"footer-tag\">Nodes &nbsp;<span>203,769</span> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Edges &nbsp;<span>{total_edges_val:,}</span></div>\n",
    "    <div class=\"footer-tag\">AUC &nbsp;<span>0.957</span> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Recall &nbsp;<span>0.910</span> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Detection Increase &nbsp;<span>1,971%</span></div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"footer-divider\"></div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n",
    "    This dashboard was produced as part of an independent fraud analytics research project on the Elliptic Bitcoin Dataset.\n",
    "    All analysis, feature engineering, GNN training and visualisation were conducted by Opeyemi Mercy Lawan. &copy; 2025\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "</footer>\n",
    "<div style=\"height:28px\"></div>\"\"\"\n",
    "print('✅ HTML body ready')"
   ]
  },
